      <rules>
        <rule id="7191aade-fd8b-5d6a-87cc-7389d4f432f9" name="Create Panic" hidden="false">
          <description>This model displaces all models when it moves, place them up to 1” Away. Immobile units prevent this model from moving there.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="76f90723-2d69-5d57-8ef0-f91434b03c5b" name="Land Train" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may only Pivot up to 1”. It may still move as normal.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="9282e38d-ced6-5508-8ac0-06eb269648be" name="Repair Facility" hidden="false">
          <description>Fire Shield Battlecars share their Void Shield # with the Cars and Trains they are connected to. If one breaks it breaks for all of them. They may also repair d3 Wounds on themselves or a neighboring car, and on a 3+ restore a secondary service from the Titanic Vehicle Penetration Table.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4468c0e9-9e01-5635-ad2c-cb0957cf26fd" name="Train Car" hidden="false">
          <description>Each Car is towed by the Train. If a Car is destroyed, the model stays on the table, even if it explodes. Reduce the Train’s Movement, Advances, Charges, and Fall Backs by -1 for each Car destroyed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
